                        // If body contains echo, we should print echo repeatedly? But original's infinite loop prints the echo inside each iteration
                        // For "while true; do break; done" there is no echo, so it hangs silently
                        // For "while true; do echo hi; break; done" it prints hi repeatedly
                        // So we need to loop printing
                        // Instead of truly infinite, we will loop for a while and then block
